content:
Evidence from the datasheet: one SKU (LP-RJ452G-TC) with two application/link configurations—2.5 Gb/s (2.5GBASE-T / IEEE 802.3bz, Cat 6A/7) and 1 Gb/s (1000BASE-T, Cat 5e)—per Applications, Description, and Table 5 (1000–2500 Mb/s). Shared mechanical form: SFP+ host footprint with front RJ-45. Power: features cite max 2.5 W with 2.5 Gb/s capability; Table 1 cites 1.2 W max for the +3.3 V interface—paired to those link modes respectively. No penalties were supplied in the input.

